  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Despite the change-log for 0.12.0p4 describing the audio bug for player voices as \"fixed\", the bug is now worse than ever. Where it would take around 1-2 hours for the audio glitch to begin manifesting itself before the patch, it now takes just 5-10 minutes before it starts happening. I have tested this using a simple generic avatar with no audio sources whatsoever and the audio bug still happens within 10 minutes.\n\nAdditionally, the bug not only effects player voices as the change-log suggests, but also all other kinds of audio input. This includes both audio sources attached to players and ones present as a part of the world.",
